    <bpmn:process id="W_W277" name="W277. Freight Bill Audit &amp; Payment (FBAP) Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: 3PL or freight forwarder submits a consolidated invoice for hundreds of deliveries/transfers.
Frequency: Weekly / Monthly
Volume: Thousands of lines per invoice; estimated ~1,700–2,600 DC-to-store delivery shipments/month (W4: 2–3 deliveries/store/week × 200 stores) + ~30–40 inter-DC transfers/month (W22 canon) + ~10,000–17,000 home delivery shipments/month (W19) = ~12,000–20,000 freight-billable movements/month across 4 DCs and multiple 3PL carriers
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst
Participants: Logistics Finance Analyst, Logistics Manager (rate card negotiation), 3PL Account Manager (dispute resolution), AP Clerk (payment processing), Controller (variance approval)
Source: workflow W277 — Freight Bill Audit &amp; Payment (FBAP) Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W277_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W277_Lane1" name="3PL">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W277_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W277_Lane3" name="Logistics Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W277_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W277_Start5" name="3PL or freight forwarder submits a consolidated invoice for hundreds of…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W277_Task6" name="3PL submits an EDI or portal-based invoice containing freight charges, fuel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: 3PL submits an EDI or portal-based invoice containing freight charges, fuel surcharges, and accessorial fees.
Responsible (R): 3PL / Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: 30 min/import</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W277_Task7" name="ERP Transportation Management module automatically audits the invoice against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: ERP Transportation Management module automatically audits the invoice against the negotiated rate cards, actual weight/cube, and route distance.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W277_Task8" name="System flags discrepancies (e.g., overcharges, duplicate billings) beyond a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System flags discrepancies (e.g., overcharges, duplicate billings) beyond a tolerance of 1%.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W277_Task9" name="Analyst reviews flagged exceptions and issues a dispute/short-pay notice to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Analyst reviews flagged exceptions and issues a dispute/short-pay notice to the 3PL.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W277_Task10" name="Approved, reconciled amounts are released to AP for payment.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Approved, reconciled amounts are released to AP for payment.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): AP Supervisor
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W277_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W277_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W277_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W277_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: audit engine is the only viable control; operational: routing is ambiguous
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W277_Assoc13" sourceRef="W277_Annotation12" targetRef="W277_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
