    <bpmn:process id="W_W435" name="W435. Intercompany Service Level Agreement (SLA) Fee Billing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close cycle (W9A)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 5 Legal Entities
Owner: Intercompany Accountant
Participants: Controller, DC Managers, Ecom Manager, Finance Managers
Source: workflow W435 — Intercompany Service Level Agreement (SLA) Fee Billing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W435_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W435_Lane1" name="Intercompany Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W435_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W435_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W435_Start4" name="Month-end close cycle (W9A)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W435_Task5" name="Data Extraction">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Data Extraction: Extract monthly service volumes: (a) Logistics: pallets stored/moved, (b) Digital: ecom orders fulfilled, (c) Property: sqm leased, (d) Holdings: management service hours
Responsible (R): Intercompany Accountant
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W435_Task6" name="Fee Calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fee Calculation: Apply the pre-approved SLA rates (per W305 rule master) to the actual volumes to determine the monthly fee per entity
Responsible (R): Intercompany Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W435_Task7" name="Intercompany Invoice">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Intercompany Invoice: System auto-generates Intercompany Invoices (Dr. Expense / Cr. IC Payable for Depot; Dr. IC Receivable / Cr. Service Revenue for service entity)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Intercompany Accountant
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W435_Task8" name="SLA Performance Review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: SLA Performance Review: Compare actual volumes vs. budget; if variances &gt; 20%, provide justification for the management report (W35)
Responsible (R): Intercompany Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W435_Task9" name="Settlement">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Settlement: Trigger intercompany cash settlement per W14.8 to clear the IC balances
Responsible (R): Intercompany Accountant
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W435_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W435_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W435_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W435_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: Intercompany Accountant review and approval gate
Owner: Intercompany Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W435_Assoc12" sourceRef="W435_Annotation11" targetRef="W435_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W435_Flow13" sourceRef="W435_Start4" targetRef="W435_Task5" />
