    <bpmn:process id="W_W475" name="W475. Customer Creditable Withholding Tax (CWT) Certificate (BIR 2307) Collection &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B/Trade customer submits payment net of withholding tax (withholds 1% or 2% Expanded Withholding Tax)
Frequency: Daily cash application; monthly collections review; quarterly tax filing
Volume: ~3,500 trade/corporate invoices monthly across 5,200 active B2B accounts
Owner: AR Accountant
Participants: B2B Customers, AR Supervisor, Collector, Tax Accountant, Controller
Source: workflow W475 — Customer Creditable Withholding Tax (CWT) Certificate (BIR 2307) Collection &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W475_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W475_Lane1" name="AR Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W475_Lane2" name="Collector">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W475_Lane3" name="Tax Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W475_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W475_Start5" name="B2B/Trade customer submits payment net of withholding tax (withholds 1% or 2% Expanded…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task6" name="Payment Posting (Net)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Payment Posting (Net): Upon receipt of check, bank transfer, or PDC (W1380), AR Accountant posts the cash received (98% or 99% of invoice) and moves the withheld 1% or 2% to a &quot;CWT Clearing - Customer Suspense&quot; account under that specific customer sub-ledger, keeping the invoice partially open.
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task7" name="Form 2307 Request">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Form 2307 Request: Collector requests the BIR Form 2307 from the customer. The customer must provide it either: (a) upon payment release (for check pickups), or (b) quarterly (within 20 days after the end of the quarter).
Responsible (R): Collector
Accountable (A): AR Accountant
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task8" name="Document Validation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Document Validation: Upon receipt, AR Accountant validates the Form 2307: (a) Correct registered name and TIN of BuildRight Depot entity, (b) Correct customer name and TIN, (c) Matching Alphanumeric Tax Code (ATC) and withholding rate (1% or 2%), (d) Matching gross sales amount and tax withheld, (e) Valid signature of customer representative.
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 10 min/cert</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task9" name="ERP Logging &amp; AR Clearance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: ERP Logging &amp; AR Clearance: AR Accountant enters the Form 2307 details (Certificate Number, Customer TIN, ATC, gross amount, tax withheld) into the ERP&#x27;s Tax Module; uploads the scanned certificate (W255); system automatically posts a journal entry: *Dr. Creditable Withholding Tax Asset / Cr. CWT Clearing - Customer Suspense*, fully closing the customer&#x27;s outstanding invoice balance.
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task10" name="Form 2307 Aging &amp; Follow-up">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Form 2307 Aging &amp; Follow-up: Monthly, AR Accountant runs the CWT Clearing Aging Report. For any pending certificates &gt; 45 days, Collector sends formal demand letters to customers. Unresolved items &gt; 90 days are blocked from further credit sales (W24/W328) until the certificate is submitted.
Responsible (R): AR Accountant / Collector
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task11" name="Tax Credit Claim Reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Tax Credit Claim Reconciliation: Quarterly, Tax Accountant reconciles total balance in *Creditable Withholding Tax Asset* account against the physical/digital Form 2307 register. The total sum is claimed as a tax credit in the Quarterly Corporate Income Tax Return (BIR Form 1702Q). Only validated, physically held certificates are claimed.
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W475_Task12" name="Audit Prep &amp; Archiving">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Audit Prep &amp; Archiving: Original Form 2307 certificates are filed and archived by the Tax Team per the 10-year retention policy (W256) for potential BIR audits (W77).
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1 hour/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W475_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W475_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W475_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W475_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: AR Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W475_Assoc15" sourceRef="W475_Annotation14" targetRef="W475_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W475_Flow16" sourceRef="W475_Start5" targetRef="W475_Task6" />
