    <bpmn:process id="W_W499" name="W499. BIR Percentage Tax Computation &amp; Payment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly percentage tax filing deadline (BIR Form 2551Q, due within 25 days after end of quarter)
Frequency: Quarterly per entity; annual monitoring
Volume: Up to 5 entities × 4 quarters = 20 filings/year; most entities are VAT-registered so percentage tax applies only to specific revenue streams
Owner: Tax Accountant
Participants: Controller, Treasury Analyst
Source: workflow W499 — BIR Percentage Tax Computation &amp; Payment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W499_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W499_Lane1" name="System">
