        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: VAT registration creates retroactive compliance requirements
Owner: Tax Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
