    <bpmn:process id="W_W752" name="W752. Intercompany Management Fee Allocation &amp; Monthly Billing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly IC billing cycle (1st business day of month)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 5 legal entities × management fee allocations
Owner: Finance Manager (Consolidation)
Participants: FP&amp;A Analyst, Finance Manager, Entity Controllers, Treasury (W30)
Source: workflow W752 — Intercompany Management Fee Allocation &amp; Monthly Billing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W752_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W752_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W752_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W752_Lane3" name="Finance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W752_Lane4" name="Entity Controllers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W752_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W752_Start6" name="Monthly IC billing cycle (1st business day of month)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W752_Task7" name="Cost pool compilation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cost pool compilation: FP&amp;A Analyst compiles monthly shared services cost pool: HQ salaries, corporate overhead, shared IT systems, shared services (finance, HR, legal), and corporate insurance
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W752_Task8" name="Allocation methodology application">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Allocation methodology application: System applies approved allocation methodology: (a) headcount-based for HR/admin costs, (b) revenue-based for executive/corporate costs, (c) transaction-volume-based for IT/finance shared services, (d) square-footage-based for property-related shared costs
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W752_Task9" name="Entity allocation calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Entity allocation calculation: System generates entity-level management fee allocation schedule with supporting calculations; each entity&#x27;s allocation shows: cost pool, allocation basis, calculated amount, and month-over-month variance
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W752_Task10" name="Review and adjustment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Review and adjustment: Finance Manager reviews allocation schedule; adjusts for one-time items (e.g., corporate restructuring, ERP implementation costs); documents adjustments with transfer pricing justification (W235)
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W752_Task11" name="IC invoice generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: IC invoice generation: System auto-generates intercompany management fee invoices from Holdings to each operating entity; invoices include allocation methodology, calculation detail, and supporting documentation
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W752_Task12" name="IC recording and settlement">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: IC recording and settlement: Each entity records IC payable (Holdings records IC receivable); settled via IC net settlement process (W14) along with other IC transactions
Responsible (R): Entity Controllers
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W752_Task13" name="Transfer pricing documentation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Transfer pricing documentation: Monthly allocation added to annual transfer pricing documentation file (W235); supports PAS 24 related party disclosure (W486)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W752_Task14" name="Quarterly benchmarking review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly benchmarking review: Quarterly: Finance reviews management fee rates against external benchmarks; adjusts if rates fall outside arm&#x27;s-length range per transfer pricing guidelines
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W752_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W752_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W752_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W752_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: Finance Manager (Consolidation) review and approval gate
Owner: Finance Manager (Consolidation)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W752_Assoc17" sourceRef="W752_Annotation16" targetRef="W752_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W752_Flow18" sourceRef="W752_Start6" targetRef="W752_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W752_Flow19" sourceRef="W752_Task7" targetRef="W752_Task8" />
