    <bpmn:process id="W_W767" name="W767. Vendor Rebate Claim Filing &amp; Settlement Documentation Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Rebate qualifying period end (monthly/quarterly/annual per vendor agreement)
Frequency: Monthly for top vendors; quarterly for standard vendors
Volume: ~20–30 rebate claims per month representing ~PHP 30-50M in rebate accruals
Owner: Procurement Analyst
Participants: Category Manager, Procurement Analyst, AP Accountant, Vendor
Source: workflow W767 — Vendor Rebate Claim Filing &amp; Settlement Documentation Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W767_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W767_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W767_Lane2" name="Procurement Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W767_Lane3" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W767_Lane4" name="AP Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W767_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W767_Start6" name="Rebate qualifying period end (monthly/quarterly/annual per vendor agreement)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W767_Task7" name="Rebate eligibility calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Rebate eligibility calculation: System calculates qualifying purchases per vendor agreement: (a) volume-based rebates: total purchases vs. tier thresholds, (b) growth rebates: current period vs. same period prior year, (c) promotional rebates: qualifying SKU sell-through per W513, (d) new product launch support per W761
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Procurement Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W767_Task8" name="Documentation package compilation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Documentation package compilation: Procurement Analyst compiles claim documentation: (a) purchase history report (PO numbers, dates, quantities, values), (b) goods receipt confirmations, (c) qualifying sell-through data for promotional rebates, (d) price list verification for price protection rebates per W161
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2-4 hours/claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W767_Task9" name="Claim submission">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Claim submission: Procurement Analyst submits claim through vendor portal (W705) or direct communication: (a) claim form per vendor requirements, (b) supporting documentation, (c) claim amount with calculation detail, (d) settlement preference (credit note against AP, wire transfer, or deduction from next payment)
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour/claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W767_Task10" name="Vendor dispute resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor dispute resolution: If vendor disputes claim: (a) Category Manager engages vendor for resolution meeting, (b) review disputed line items against contract terms per W669, (c) agree on revised claim amount or provide additional documentation, (d) document resolution for audit trail per W351
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 2-8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W767_Task11" name="Settlement processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Settlement processing: Upon vendor approval: (a) AP Accountant records settlement per agreed method: credit note reduces AP balance, wire transfer recorded per W89, or payment deduction applied per W556; (b) system reconciles against original accrual per W27; (c) variance between accrual and settlement posted to P&amp;L
Responsible (R): AP Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 1 hour/claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W767_Task12" name="Rebate tracking dashboard update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Rebate tracking dashboard update: System updates rebate tracking: (a) total accruals vs. settlements by vendor, (b) outstanding claims aging, (c) disputed claims, (d) settlement rate (target: 95% of accruals settled within 60 days)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Procurement Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W767_Task13" name="Quarterly rebate analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly rebate analytics: Procurement Analyst reports: (a) total rebate income by category and vendor, (b) settlement rate and average time-to-settlement, (c) disputed claim analysis, (d) rebate income as % of COGS, (e) accrual accuracy (accrued vs. settled variance)
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W767_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W767_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W767_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W767_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-284 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Processing &amp; Matching (PA-15.1).) | - operational: Procurement Analyst review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Procurement Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W767_Assoc16" sourceRef="W767_Annotation15" targetRef="W767_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W767_Flow17" sourceRef="W767_Start6" targetRef="W767_Task7" />
